# Sightline needs no secrets to build or run. There is no backend, no analytics and no login.
# These are the public providers the app talks to, listed for review. They are set in code
# (src/features/explore/mapShared.ts and src/data/overpass.ts); nothing here is read at runtime.
#
# Basemap tiles (no key, attribution required, no bulk/offline prefetch):
#   https://tiles.openfreemap.org/styles/positron   (light)
#   https://tiles.openfreemap.org/styles/dark       (dark)
# Camera data, only on an explicit "Download"/"Refresh" tap (bounded query, no key):
#   https://overpass-api.de/api/interpreter
#
# For production, host region extracts on your own static server/CDN instead of public Overpass.
